    "urn:eigenius:core:is_a": ["urn:eigenius:core:Class"],
    "urn:eigenius:core:description": "Kernel-tracked recipe that produced a RuntimeEnvironment image (D60). Records the deterministic build's inputs — the digest-pinned base image, the composed Dockerfile, the content hashes of each baked-in artifact (worker binary, packages), the exact build command, and the builder + version — so 'how the image was built' is a chain-resident, content-verified fact rather than an ad-hoc shell script. `eigenius env build` emits it and commits it with the RuntimeEnvironment (referenced via runtime:build_recipe); `eigenius env build --verify` reproduces the image digest from this recipe and fails closed on drift. Generalizes across runtimes (oci, r, julia, lean).",
